canvas 460 280
label "Bundle layout: one directory holding agsc.config.json, content/index.md, one Markdown file per item under content/<type-plural>/ (highlighted) and attachments; imports enter the directory and lossless exports leave it"
caption "The highlighted item files are the whole knowledge base; configuration, the root document and attachments are the only other things in the tree."
region dir 16 20 260 232 "one directory"
box cfg 30 40 232 36 "agsc.config.json (closed)"
box idx 30 86 232 36 "content/index.md (root document)"
box items 30 132 232 50 "content/<type-plural>/<slug>.md|one item per file" acc
box att 30 192 232 36 "content/attachments/<slug>/…"
box imp 300 60 140 50 "import|(OKF, bare Markdown)"
box exp 300 160 140 50 "export|(lossless)"
arrow imp dir
arrow dir exp
note "everything a node knows is in this tree; nothing lives anywhere else"
